---
import Snippet from './Snippet.astro'

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL

const code = `@Module({
  providers: [UsersService],
  controllers: [UsersController],
})
export class UsersModule {}

export class UsersService {
  readonly #repository = inject(UsersRepository)
}`
---

<section class="wiring" aria-labelledby="wiring">
  <div class="head">
    <h2 id="wiring">Modules &amp; DI</h2>
    <p class="claim">Wiring mistakes fail at startup, not on a request.</p>
    <p class="text">
      Modules group controllers and providers. A class asks for what it needs with <code>inject()</code>, typed by its
      token. The whole graph is checked when the application starts: a missing provider, a cycle or a provider that is
      not exported stops it with the chain that led there and the fix.
    </p>
    <a href={`${base}docs/providers-and-modules/#errors-at-startup`}>Providers and modules</a>
  </div>

  <div class="pair">
    <Snippet code={code} caption="UsersRepository is not provided" />
    <figure class="terminal">
      <figcaption>Terminal</figcaption>
      <pre><span class="dim">$</span> bun dev
<span class="err">DiError:</span> No provider for <b>UsersRepository</b> in <b>UsersModule</b>
<span class="hl">(UsersService → UsersRepository)</span>
<span class="fix">Add it to the providers of UsersModule, or import a module that exports it.</span>
<span class="dim">    at new UsersService (src/users/users.service.ts:4:24)</span></pre>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .wiring {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7.5rem);
  }

  .head {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .claim {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 2.6vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .text {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .text code {
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--fg);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .head a {
    justify-self: start;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .head a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }

  .pair {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .pair {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
    }
  }

  .terminal {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: #050505;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .terminal figcaption {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .terminal pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    color: #bdbdbd;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }

  .terminal b {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .err {
    color: #ff6b5e;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hl {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .fix {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .dim {
    color: #5a5a5a;
  }
</style>
